Additive on v3 (mono-brutalist skin kept verbatim). Six additions:
- Needs-Attention lane (Overview top): ranked from real PR CI/mergeable +
  GraphQL review threads (ready-to-merge / CI-fail / conflict), deep-linked;
  stale-claims is a SEAM (7dc229d4).
- Board Active/Archived toggle (Active hides Done for a clean live set).
- Epics collapse-by-default; expand -> children as 1/3-width cards, 3/row,
  ordered by priority (density fix).
- Click-through detail slide-over (epic OR any task/child): summary-first meta
  + body + children-as-cards; linked PR/decision/plan = SEAM (56461780).
- Workspaces view: worktree = card with real git ahead/behind/dirty + linked
  PR/CI + Active/Archived filter; linked-task/phase/harness = SEAM.
- Memory view: activity + work-folder card grid (not sidebar) + filter;
  Graphiti graph = SEAM (c7971150). Backlog view: honest SEAM (b2f856b1).

Generator: enriched PRs (ci rollup/mergeable/ready), merged PRs, worktree
ahead/behind/dirty + PR link + archived, needsAttention[], seams{} map.
app.test.js +wtSummary (11 tests). Verified dark+light in-browser; no accent.

Refs: 21cc7139-b088-4e23-a69c-82840e170394

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
